<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Treasury offers A$1.0 bln of notes.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Treasury offers A$1.0 bln of notes.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Treasury will offer a total of A$1.0 billion of Treasury notes for tender on Wednesday, the Reserve Bank of Australia said.</p>
